  <para style="m" vid="NEH 7:38">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:38" />
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />
    <char style="w">Banganga-Nzambi</char> vwandaka:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start" />
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Yedaya, yina butukaka na Yeswa: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">973</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:39" />
        <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />
      </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Imele: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">1 052</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:40" />
        <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />
      </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Pasewule: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">1 247</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:41" />
        <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />
      </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Alime: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">1 017</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 7:42">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:42" />
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Ba-Levi:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start" />
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Yeswa, na Kademyele mpe bantu ya dikanda ya Odewa: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">74</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:43" />
  </para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Miyimbidi ya Yinzo ya Yave:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start" />
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bantu ya dikanda ya Asafe: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">148</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:44">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:44" />
  </para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Bankebi ya myelo ya Yinzo ya Yave, ya vwandaka:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start" />
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Bana ya makanda ya Salume, ya Atele, ya Talemone, ya Akube, ya Atita mpe ya Sobayi: </cell>
      <cell style="tc3" align="start">138</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:45">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:45" />
  </para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Bisadi ya Yinzo ya Yave: bana ya makanda ya Siya, bana ya makanda ya Yasufa, bana ya makanda ya Tabawote, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />bana ya makanda ya Kelose, bana ya makanda ya Siya, bana ya makanda ya Padone, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />bana ya makanda ya Lebana, bana ya makanda ya Yangaba, bana ya makanda ya Salemayi, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />bana ya makanda ya Yanane, bana ya makanda ya Ngidele, bana ya makanda ya Ngayale, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />bana ya makanda ya Leyaya, bana ya makanda ya Lesine, bana ya makanda ya Nekoda, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />bana ya makanda ya Ngazame, bana ya makanda ya Wuza, bana ya makanda ya Paseya, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />bana ya makanda ya Besayi, bana ya makanda ya Mewunime, bana ya makanda ya Nefisesime, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />bana ya makanda ya Bakebuke, bana ya makanda ya Akufa, bana ya makanda ya Alule, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />bana ya makanda ya Baselite, bana ya makanda ya Meyida, bana ya makanda ya Yalesa, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />bana ya makanda ya Balekose, bana ya makanda ya Sisela, bana ya makanda ya Tema, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />bana ya makanda ya Nesiya mpe bana ya makanda ya Yatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Makanda ya bisadi ya Salomoni: bana ya makanda ya Sotayi, bana ya makanda ya Sofelete, bana ya makanda ya Pelida, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />bana ya makanda ya Yaala, bana ya makanda ya Dalekone, bana ya makanda ya Ngidele, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />bana ya makanda ya Sefatya, bana ya makanda ya Atile, bana ya makanda ya Pokelete-Asebayime mpe bana ya makanda ya Amone.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Lutangu ya bisadi yina vwandaka sala na Yinzo ya Yave na bana ya bisadi ya Salomoni vwandaka bankama tatu na makumi yivwa na zole (392).<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />«Bantu yina katukaka na bambanza Tele-Mela, Tele-Yalesa, Kelube-Adane, mpe Imele, bawu lendaka ve na kutuba kana ya tsyelika makanda ya bankooko ya bawu vwandaka bantu ya Isayeli. Bantu yango ni yayi: <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Bankama sambanu na makumi yiya na zole (642) kele lutangu ya bantu ya makanda ya Delaya, ya Tobiya, mpe Nekoda.»<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />«Bantu ya nkaka na kati ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>: bantu ya makanda ya Obaya, ya Akose, mpe ya Balezilayi. Ba pesaka Balezilayi nkumbu yayi, samu ti, yandi kwelaka mwana ya Balazilayi ya kento. Yandi kele muntu ya bwala Ngalaade. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Bawu sosaka mikanda yina ba sonikaka bankumbu ya bankooko ya bawu, kasi bawu talaka yawu ve. Ni yawu yina, ba talaka bawu mutindu bantu ya <char style="w">kuvedila</char> ve mpe ba yiminaka bawu na kusala kisalu ya <char style="w">bunganga-Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Mpe mfumu ya kizunga yiminaka bawu na kudya madya ya longo tii ntangu yina <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> ke kwiza sadila bima ya longo yina ba ke bokilaka Ulime mpe Tumime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.65 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulime mpe Tumime vwandaka mwa bima yina nganga-Nzambi ya ntete vwandaka sadila mutindu dzeke samu na kuzaba luzolo ya Nzambi. Tala na Kbk 28.30</char></note>.»<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />«Lutangu nyonso ya bantu ya Isayeli yina katukaka na bundongo vwandaka mafunda makumi yiya na zole na bankama tatu na makumi sambanu (42 360), <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.67 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na mabuku ya nkaka ya ntama na bandinga ya Ebeleyo mpe ya Ngeleke, ba bwelaka na nsuka ya kibuku yayi mambu yayi mutindu yawu kele na Esd 2.66: bampunda bankama nsambwadi na makumi tatu na sambanu (736), bampunda ya mutela ya nkufi bankama zole na makumi yiya na tanu (245).</char></note> na zulu ya lutangu yina ya vwandaka mpe na bisadi ya bawu ya bakento na ya babakala mafunda nsambwadi na bankama tatu na makumi tatu na nsambwadi (7 337), ya vwandaka mpe na miyimbidi ya bakento na ya babakala bankama zole na makumi yiya na tanu (245), <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />basamo bankama yiya na makumi tatu na tanu (435), mpe bambuluku mafunda sambanu na bankama nsambwadi na makumi zole (6 720). <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Ndambu ya bamfumu ya nkaka ya makanda pesaka makabu samu na kisalu ya Yinzo ya Yave. <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya kizunga pesaka funda mosi (1 000) ya bisengo ya wolo, bambungu makumi tanu mpe biyunga ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> bankama tanu na makumi tatu (530). <verse eid="NEH 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Bamfumu ya nkaka ya makanda pesaka mafunda makumi zole (20 000) ya bisengo ya wolo, mafunda zole na bankama zole (2 200) ya Mine<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17">1Bt 10.17</ref></char></note> ya palata. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Bantu ya nkaka ya makanda ya Isayeli pesaka mafunda makumi zole (20 000) ya Badalike<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.71 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:7">1Kk 29.7</ref></char></note> ya wolo, mafunda zole (2 000) ya Mine<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.71 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17">1Bt 10.17</ref></char></note> ya palata na makumi sambanu na nsambwadi ya biyunga ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>.»<verse eid="NEH 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />«<char style="w">Banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> mpe bantu ya nkaka ya Isayeli, miyimbidi, bankebi ya myelo, miyimbidi, mwa ndambu ya bantu mpe bisadi yina vwandaka sala na Yinzo ya Yave, mpe bantu nyonso ya Isayeli, bawu kwendaka vwanda na bambanza yina ba pesaka bawu. Bantu ya Isayeli kwendaka zinga na bambanza ya bawu na ngonda ya nsambwadi.»<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Bantu nyonso yonzamaka mutindu muntu mosi kuna na Yelusalemi, na kisika yina kele na mantwala ya mwelo, yina ba ke bokilaka mwelo ya Maza. Ba lombaka na <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> Esedase, yina vwandaka mpe <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>, na kunata dibuku ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Moyize, yina Yave pesaka na bana ya Isayeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" /><char style="w">Nganga-Nzambi</char> Esedase nataka dibuku yango ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> na mantwala ya nkonga ya bantu nyonso. Bayina vwandaka kuna ni bakento na babakala, mpe konso muntu yina vwandaka na mayela ya kuvisa mambu yina zolaka wakana kuna. Ya vwandaka kilumbu ya ntete ya ngonda ya nsambwadi. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Kubanda na suka tii na midi, Esedase telamaka na kisika yina kele na mantwala ya mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka mwelo ya Maza. Yandi telamaka na mantwala ya bakento na babakala, mpe konso muntu yina vwandaka na mayela ya kuvisa. Yandi tangilaka bawu dibuku ya <char style="w">Musiku</char>. Bantu nyonso fungulaka makutu na kulanda mambu ya <char style="w">Musiku</char>.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Esedase, <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>, telamaka na kisika ya kuzangama yina ba yidikaka na mabaya, samu na dyambu yina. Pene-pene na yandi, na diboko ya lubakala, vwandaka Matitya, Sema, Anaya, Wuliya, Yilekiya mpe Maaseya. Na diboko ya yandi ya lumoso vwandaka Pedaya, Misayele, Malekiya, Asume, Asebadana, Zakali mpe Mesulame. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Esedase zibulaka dibuku na meso ya bantu nyonso, samu ti yandi vwandaka ya kutelama na mwa zulu. Ntangu yandi zibulaka yawu, bantu nyonso telamaka. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Esedase tondaka Yave, Nzambi ya nene. Bantu nyonso nangunaka maboko mpe tubaka: «<char style="w">Ameni</char>! Ameni!» Bawu yinamaka mpe fukamaka bizizi na ntoto na mantwala ya Yave. <verse eid="NEH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Ba-Levi: Yeswa, Bani, Selebya, Yamine, Akuve, Sabetayi, Odya, Maaseya, Kelita, Azalya, Yozabade, Anane, na Pelaya, vwandaka bangudila bantu <char style="w">Musiku</char>. Mpe bantu vwandaka kaka ya kutelama. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Bawu vwandaka tanga na dibuku ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Nzambi na pwelele nyonso. Bawu vwandaka pesa bawu nsasa ya mambu yango, samu ti bantu kuvisa yawu.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Na yina, Neyemi mfumu ya kizunga, na <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> Esedase yina vwandaka mpe <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>, na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> yina vwandaka bangudila bantu mambu, bawu tubaka na bantu nyonso: «Kilumbu yayi kele kilumbu ya longo samu na Yave, Nzambi ya beno. Beno kuvwanda ve na kyadi mpe beno kudila ve.» Samu ti bantu nyonso vwandaka dila ntangu bawu vwandaka kuwa mambu ya <char style="w">Musiku</char>. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Esedase tubaka na bawu: «Beno kwenda na bayinzo ya beno, beno kudya madya ya kitoko, beno kunwa malafu ya mbote mpe beno kabula na bantu yina me lamba ve, samu ti Kilumbu yayi ke kilumbu ya longo samu na <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya beto. Beno vwanda ve na kyadi! Samu ti kyese ya Yave kele ngolo ya beno.» <verse eid="NEH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Ba-Levi vwandaka dingimisa bantu nyonso na kutuba: «Beno vwanda swii! Kilumbu yayi ke kilumbu ya longo. Beno vwanda ve na kyadi!»<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Na yina, bantu nyonso kwendaka na bayinzo ya bawu, samu na kudya mpe kunwa. Bawu kabulaka madya na bampangi. Bawu lakisaka kyese ya mingi, samu ti bawu visaka nsasa ya mambu yina ba zabisaka bawu.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="w">Mukembo ya Mileba</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Kilumbu yina landaka, bamfumu ya makanda nyonso, <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bawu yonzamaka pene-pene na Esedase, <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>, samu na kusosa kuzaba nsasa ya mambu ya <char style="w">Musiku</char>. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Na kati ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> yina Yave pesaka na Moyize, ba talaka ti ya ke ya kusonama ti bana ya Isayeli fwana kuzinga na kati ya Mileba, na ntangu ya mukembo ya ngonda ya nsambwadi. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Samu na <char style="w">mukembo</char> yango, ba fwana kuzabisa mpe kumwangisa nsangu na bambanza ya bawu nyonso, mpe na Yelusalemi: «Beno kwenda na mongo mpe beno kwenda baka makasa ya bayinti ya olive, mpe makasa ya bayinti ya olive ya mfinda. Beno nata mpe makasa ya miite, mandala, na makasa ya bayinti yina ke na makasa mingi, samu na kutunga Mileba mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama.»<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Na yina, bantu nyonso basikaka mpe bawu nataka bima ya kuyidikila mileba, konso muntu na zulu ya muludi ya yandi. Ba ya nkaka na bangaanda ya bawu, ba ya nkaka na ngaanda ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, ba ya nkaka na kisika yina kele na mantwala ya mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka mwelo ya Maza. Ba ya nkaka na kisika yina kele na mantwala ya mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka mwelo ya Efalayime. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Nkonga ya bantu nyonso yina vwandaka kuna, bayina katukaka na bundongo, bawu tungaka mileba mpe bawu zingaka na kati. Yawu vwandaka kyese ya kulutila, samu ti, bantu ya Isayeli salaka ntete ve, <char style="w">mukembo</char> ya nene ya mutindu yayi, katuka ntangu ya Yeswa, mwana ya Nune. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Kubanda na kilumbu ya ntete tii ya nsuka ya mukembo, konso kilumbu ba vwandaka tanga dibuku ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Nzambi. Mukembo zingilaka bilumbu nsambwadi. Na kilumbu ya nana, bawu salaka lukutakanu ya nene samu na kukanga mukembo, mutindu vwandaka kinkulu ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bantu fungulaka masumu ya bawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Na kilumbu ya makumi zole na yiya, na ngonda yina ya nsambwadi, bantu ya Isayeli vukanaka samu na kumina nsoki, bawu lwataka bangoto mpe bawu yobilaka ntoto. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Bantu nyonso ya Isayeli kabukaka na bantu ya nzenza. Bawu telamaka mpe bawu vwandaka fungula masumu ya bawu na ya bankooko ya bawu. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Bawu telamaka na kisika yina bawu vwandaka. Na bangunga tatu, ba tangaka dibuku ya <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Yave, Nzambi ya bawu. Na bangunga tatu ya nkaka dyaka, bawu fungulaka masumu ya bawu, mpe bawu fukamaka na ntadisi ya Yave, Nzambi ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Yeswa, Bani, Kademyele, Sebanya, Buni, Selebya, Bani, na Kenani, bawu telamaka na kisika yina ya kuzangama ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, mpe bawu yawulaka na ndinga ya ngolo na Yave, Nzambi ya bawu. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Mpe, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> Yeswa, Kademyele, Bani, Asabeneya, Selebya, Odya, Sebanya, na Petaya, bawu tubaka: «Beno telama, beno tonda Yave, beno tonda Nzambi ya beno ya bantangu nyonso!»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 9:5">Lusambulu ya nene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">Ba sambilaka: «Yave, bika ti ba zitisa nkumbu ya nge ya nkembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">nkumbu yina me lutila lusakumunu nyonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:5">mpe masiika nyonso!<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ni nge kele Yave, kaka nge mosi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">Ni nge yidikaka <char style="w">mazulu</char> nyonso na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">bambwetete nyonso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">Ni nge yidikaka ntoto na bima nyonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">yina kele na yawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">Ni nge yidikaka mubu mpe bima nyonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">yina kele na kati ya yawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">Ni nge ke pesaka luzingu na bima nyonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">yina ke wumunaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">Binwani nyonso ya <char style="w">mazulu</char> ke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:6">fukamaka na ntwala ya nge.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Ni nge kele Yave, Nzambi yina soolaka Abalami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:7">Nge basisaka yandi na mbanza Ule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:7">na yinsi ya Kalede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:7">Mpe nge pesaka yandi nkumbu ya Abalayami.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Nge talaka ti yandi vwandaka ya kukwikama na nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">mpe nge salaka ngwisani na yandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">samu na kupesa yandi yinsi yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">vwandaka zinga ba-Kaanani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">ba-Iti, ba-Amoli, ba-Pelizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">ba-Yebuse, na ba-Ngilengazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">Nge pesaka yawu na bana ya yandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">Nge lungisaka mambu ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:8">samu ti, nge kele ya <char style="w">kudedama</char>.»<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />«Nge talaka bampasi ya bankooko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:9">ya beto na yinsi ya Ngipiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:9">nge kuwaka kulooka ya bawu pene-pene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:9">ya mubu ya batwandu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Mubu ya batwandu </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23-25">Kbk 2.23-25</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Mutindu nge zabaka ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">ba nyokolaka bankooko ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">nge lakisaka bidimbu na bimangu na sika ya Falawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">na bisadi ya yandi nyonso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">mpe na bantu nyonso ya yinsi ya yandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">Nge salaka ti nkumbu ya nge kuvwanda nsangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:10">mutindu yawu ke na kutalana bubu yayi.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Nge pasulaka mubu na mantwala ya bantu ya Isayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">mpe bawu lutilaka na nzila ya kuyuma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">na kati-kati ya mubu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">Nge dyamisaka bantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">yina vwandaka landa bawu na yisi ya mubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:11">mutindu ditadi na kati ya maza ya ngolo.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Na ntangu, nge vwandaka twadisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:12">bawu na dituti ya nene ya kutelama, mpe na mpimpa nge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:12">vwandaka twadisa bawu na mulaka ya tiya ya kutelama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:12">samu na kukyenzola nzila yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:12">bawu vwandaka landa.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Katuka na zulu, nge kulumukaka na mongo ya Sinayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:13">Nge zonzaka na bankooko ya beto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:13">Nge pesaka bawu bansalulu ya kusungama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:13">ya misiku, misiku ya tsyelika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:13">bandongosolo, mpe bantumunu ya mbote.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Nge salaka ti bawu kuzaba <char style="w">Saba</char> ya nge ya longo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:14">Nge pesaka bawu bantumunu, na bandongosolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:14">na <char style="w">Musiku</char> na nzila ya kisyelo ya nge Moyize.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka na nsatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">nge pesaka bawu mampa yina katukaka na zulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">Ntangu bawu vwandaka na nsatu ya maza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">nge basisilaka bawu maza na ditadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">Nge tubaka na bawu na kwenda kubaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">yinsi yina nge kudyaka ndefi na kupesa na bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:15">samu ti yawu kuvwanda ya bawu.»<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />«Kasi bawu na bankooko ya beto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:16">vwandaka na lunangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:16">Bawu vwandaka na yintu ngolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:16">mpe bawu sadilaka ve bantumunu ya nge.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Bawu mangaka na kuwa mpe bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">bambukaka ve moyo na bimangu yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">nge salaka samu na bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Bawu salaka yintu ngolo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Na kukondwa kutumama ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">bawu soolaka mfumu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">samu na kuvutuka na bundongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Kasi nge, nge kele Nzambi ya lemvo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">yina ke lemvokilaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Nge kele Nzambi ya kyadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">yina ke dasukaka mbangu ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">Mpe nge kele ya kufuluka na bumbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:17">mpe nge me manga bawu ve.»<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Bawu salaka kiteki ya mwana ya ngombe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:18">ya kisengo, mpe bawu tubaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:18">«Yayi ni nzambi ya nge yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:18">me basisa nge na yinsi ya Ngipiti<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-4">Kbk 32.1-4</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:18">Bawu safulaka nge mingi.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />«Kasi, samu na kyadi ya nge ya nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">nge bikaka bawu ve kuna na yinsi ya kuyuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">Ni yawu yina, na ntangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">dituti ya nene ya kutelema vwandaka kaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">na bawu, samu na kutwadisa bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">na nzila yina bawu vwandaka landa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">Na mpimpa mpe mulaka ya tiya ya kutelama vwandaka kaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:19">na bawu, samu na kukyenzola nzila yina.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Nge pesaka bawu Mpeve ya nge ya mbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:20">samu ti bawu kuvwanda na mayela ya kuswasikisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:20">Nge mangaka ve na kupesa bawu <char style="w">mane</char> ya kudya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:20">Nge pesaka bawu mpe maza ntangu bawu vwandaka na mpwila.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Na bamvula makumi yiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">nge vwandaka sadisa bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">na kupesaka bawu nyonso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">yina bawu vwandaka na yawu nsatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">na yinsi ya kuyuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">Bawu kondwaka kima ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">binkuti ya bawu bebaka ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:21">mpe makulu ya bawu vimbaka ve<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-4">Mus 8.2-4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />«Nge salaka ti ba nunga bayinsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">ya kintinu na bantu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">bayinsi yina vwandaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">ndilu na yinsi ya Kaana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">samu ti yawu kuvwanda mvwilu ya bawu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">yinsi ya ntinu Siwone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">ya mbanza kimfumu Esebone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:22">na Basane yinsi ya ntinu Onge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Ltg 21.21-35</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Nge salaka ti bana ya bawu kuma mingi mutindu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">bambwetete ya <char style="w">mazulu</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">Nge kotisaka bawu na yinsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">yina nge zabisaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">na bankooko ya bawu na kwenda kubaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:23">samu ti yawu kuvwanda ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Bana ya bawu kotaka mpe bakaka yinsi ya Kaana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">samu ti yawu kuvwanda ya bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">Nge salaka ti ba-Kaanani kuvwanda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">na yisi ya lutumu ya bawu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Ywa 11.23</ref></char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">Nge yekulaka bantu ya Kaana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">na maboko ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">mutindu mosi mpe bantinu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">na bantu nyonso ya yinsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:24">samu ti ba sala bawu mutindu ba zola.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Bawu bakaka bambanza yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">vwandaka na bibaka ya lukengolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">mpe ntoto yina ke butaka madya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">Bawu bakaka mpe bayinzo yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">vwandaka ya kufuluka na bima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">mingi ya mbote ya mutindu na mutindu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">mabulu ya maza, bilanga ya bayinti ya vinu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">bayinti ya olive, mpe bayinti mingi yina ke butaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">bambuma ya kudya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">Bawu kudyaka mpe fulukaka, bawu kumaka nene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">mpe zingaka na kilengi nyonso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:25">Nyonso yina samu na bumbote ya nge ya nene<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">Mus 6.10-11</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />«Bankooko ya beto balukilaka nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">bawu tumamaka ve na nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">Bawu pesaka manima na <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">Bawu kufwaka mimbikudi yina vwandaka kebisa bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">samu ti, bawu kuvutuka na nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:26">Bawu safulaka nge mingi.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Ni yawu yina, nge yekulaka bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">na maboko ya bambeni ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">mpe bambeni yango nyokolaka bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">Na kati ya bampasi ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">bawu yawulaka na sika ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">mpe nge, kuna na <char style="w">mazulu</char>, nge kuwaka bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">Mutindu kele kyadi ya nge ya nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">nge vwandaka pesa bawu bantu yina vwandaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:27">vuukisa bawu na maboko ya bambeni ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Kaka na ntangu yina bawu vwandaka kuzwa kizunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">bawu vwandaka vutukila na kusala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">yimbi na ntadisi ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">Nge vwandaka yekula bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">na maboko ya bambeni ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">mpe bambeni ya yango vwandaka nyokola bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">Bawu vwandaka yawulaka dyaka na sika ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">mpe nge, kuna na <char style="w">mazulu</char>, nge vwandaka kuwa bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">mpe nge vwandaka kuula bawu bambala mingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:28">mutindu kele kyadi ya nge ya nene<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Bik 2.11-16</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Nge vwandaka kebisa bawu samu ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">bawu kuvutukila na kusadila <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Kasi bawu vwandaka sala yintu ngolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">mpe bawu vwandaka tumama ve na bantumunu ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Bawu landaka ve bansalulu ya misiku ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">bawu sumunaka yawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Bandongosolo yina ke salaka ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">kana muntu kusadila yawu, yandi ke zinga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Bawu kangaka bantima ya bawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:29">Bawu salaka yintu ngolo. Bawu mangaka na kuwa.»<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />«Nge vibidilaka bawu na bamvula mingi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">Nge kebisaka bawu na Mpeve ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">na nzila ya mimbikudi ya nge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">kasi bawu mangaka na kuwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">Na yina, nge yekulaka bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:30">na maboko ya bantu ya bayinsi ya nkaka.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Na kyadi ya nge ya nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:31">nge yekulaka ve bawu samu ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:31">bawu manisa na kufwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:31">Nge bikaka bawu ve samu ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:31">nge kele Nzambi ya lemvo, Nzambi ya kyadi.»<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />«Ntangu yayi, Nzambi ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">nge kele Nzambi ya nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">Nzambi ya lulendo yina ba fwana kuzitisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">Nge ke kebaka ngwisani mpe bumbote ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">Kutala ve ti bampasi yina me kukumina beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">kele mambu ya fyoti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">Bampasi yina me kumina bantinu ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">na bamfumu ya beto, na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">na mimbikudi ya beto, na bankooko ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">mpe na bantu ya nge nyonso, kubanda na ntangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">yina bantinu ya Asili vwandaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:32">yala tii na kilumbu ya bubu yayi.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Nge, nge kele ya nge ya kusungama na mambu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:33">nyonso yina me kumina beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:33">samu ti, nge me lakisa kukwikama ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:33">Kasi beto, beto me sala yimbi.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Bantinu ya beto, bamfumu ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">
    <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">na bankooko ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">bawu sadilaka ve <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya nge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">Bawu mangaka na kutumama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">na bantumunu ya nge, mpe na kuwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:34">kukebisa yina nge vwandaka kebisa bawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Ntangu bawu vwandaka na kati ya kintinu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">mpe na kati ya bimvwama mingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">yina nge pesaka bawu na yinsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">yinsi yina ya nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">mpe yina ke butaka madya mingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">bawu sadilaka nge ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">Bawu bikaka ve na kusadila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:35">mavanga ya bawu ya yimbi.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Tala, bubu yayi beto me kuma bandongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:36">Beto me kuma bandongo na kati ya yinsi yina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:36">nge pesaka na bankooko ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:36">samu na kudya bambuma ya yawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:36">na bima nyonso ya mbote!<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Madya ya mingi ya yinsi yango kele kaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">ya bantinu yina nge tulaka na kuyala beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">samu na masumu ya beto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">Bawu ke na kuyala banzutu ya beto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">na bibulu ya beto, mutindu bawu zola.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 9:37">Mpe beto, ba ke na kunyokola beto mingi.»<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bantu bakaka lukanu ya kutumama na Musiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Samu na mambu nyonso yina me kumina beto, beto me sala kiwisa. Mambu yina beto me wisana, beto me sonika yawu na mukanda. Mukanda yango kele na binyemo ya bamfumu ya beto, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ya beto, mpe ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> ya beto. <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Yayi ni bankumbu ya bantu yina tulaka binyemo ya bawu na mukanda yango:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 10:2">- Neyemi, mfumu ya kizunga, mwana ya Akalya,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 10:2">- mpe Sidekya, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Selaya, Azalya, Yelemya, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Pasewule, Amalya, Malekya, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Atuse, Sebanya, Maluke, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Alime, Melemote, Obadya, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Danyele, Nginetone, Baluke, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Mesulame, Abya, Miyamine, <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Maaziya, Bilengayi, Semaya. Yina ni <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 10:9">- <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Ba-Levi ni bawu yayi: Yeswa, mwana ya Azanya, Binwi muntu ya dikanda ya Enadade, na Kademyele, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />mpe bampangi ya bawu: Sebanya, Odya, Kelita, Pelaya, Anane, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Mika, Leyobe, Asabya, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Zakule, Selebya, Sebanya, <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Odya, Bani, Beninu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 10:14">- <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Bamfumu ya bankonga: Palewose, Payate-Mowabe, Elame, Zatu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Buni, Azengade, Bebayi, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Adoniya, Bingwayi, Adine, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Atele, Ezekyase, Azule, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Odya, Asume, Besayi, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Alife, Anatote, Nebayi, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Mangepyase, Mesulame, Ezile, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Mesezabele, Sadoke, Yaduwa, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Pelatya, Anane, Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Oseya, Ananya, Asube, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Aloyese, Pileya, Sobeke, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Lewume, Asabena, Maaseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Ayiya, Anane, Anaane, <verse eid="NEH 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Maluke, Alime, mpe Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />Bantu ya nkaka ya yinsi, <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bankebi ya myelo, miyimbidi, bisadi ya Yinzo ya Yave mpe konso muntu yina kabukaka na bantu ya bayinsi ya nkaka, samu na kusadila <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Nzambi, bakento ya bawu, bana ya bawu ya bakento na ya babakala mpe bayina nyonso vwandaka na mayela ya kuvisa mambu, <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />bawu kwizaka vukana na bampangi ya bawu mpe na bamfumu ya bawu. Bawu kudyaka ndefi na kudyatila mutindu kele <char style="w">Musiku</char> ya Nzambi yina pesamaka na kisyelo ya Nzambi Moyize, kana ve nsingulu ya Nzambi kubwidila bawu. Samu ti, bawu kukeba mpe kusadila bantumunu nyonso ya Yave, <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya beto, bansalulu ya misiku ya yandi na bandongosolo ya yandi.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Beto me baka lukanu ya kumanga na kukwelisa bana ya beto ya bakento na bantu ya yinsi, mpe ya kukwelisa ve bana ya beto ya babakala na bana ya bawu ya bakento, <verse eid="NEH 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />ya kusumba ve madya to bima ya bantu ya bayinsi ya nkaka na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char> mpe na kilumbu ya longo. Mpe konso mvula ya nsambwadi, beto ke pemisa ntoto, mpe beto ke katula bamfuka nyonso ya bayina ke na kudefa beto. <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Beto me baka nzengolo ya kupesaka, konso mvula, bikunku tatu na kati ya bikunku kumi ya Sekele<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:15">Mba 23.15</ref></char></note> mosi, samu na kisalu ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto. <verse eid="NEH 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Mbongo yina kele mpe samu na kusumbilaka mampa yina ba ke pesaka na Nzambi, samu na minkayulu ya konso ntangu, samu na minkayulu ya kuyoka ya konso ntangu, samu na basaba, samu na <char style="w">mikembo ya bilumbu ya ntete ya bangonda</char>, samu na <char style="w">mikembo</char> ya nkaka, samu na bima ya <char style="w">kubyeka</char>, samu na minkayulu ya kukatula masumu ya Isayeli, mpe samu na konso kisalu ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Beto <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, na bantu nyonso, beto me bula dzeke samu na kuzaba na konso mvula, wapi dikanda yina ke nata dikabu ya bankuni na Yinzo ya Yave, Nzambi ya beto, na ntangu ya kufwanakana. Bankuni yina ke vwanda samu na kunamisaka tiya na kiyokolo ya minkayulu ya Yave, Nzambi ya beto, mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama na kati ya <char style="w">Musiku</char>. <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Na konso mvula, beto fwana kunataka mpe madya ya ntete ya bilanga ya beto, mpe bambuma ya ntete ya konso yinti, samu na Yinzo ya Yave. <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Bana ya beto ya ntete ya babakala, na bana ya ntete ya bibulu ya beto, mutindu mosi mpe na bana ya ntete ya mameme ya beto, bankombo ya beto, na bangombe ya beto, beto fwana kunata bawu na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto, na sika ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> yina ke salaka kuna na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto, mutindu yawu kele ya kusonama na kati ya <char style="w">Musiku</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:1-10">Kbk 13.1-10</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Beto ke pesa bambuma ya ntete ya faline ya beto, na bikunku ya Yave, na bambuma ya konso yinti, na vinu ya malu-malu, na mafuta ya malu-malu. Beto ke nata yawu na sika ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na kati ya bivinga ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto, mutindu mosi mpe <char style="w">dime</char> ya madya ya ntoto ya beto, samu na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>. Na yina, ni <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> bawu mosi ke kwenda baka kikunku ya bawu na kati ya bambanza nyonso yina beto ke sadilaka bilanga. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" /><char style="w">Nganga-Nzambi</char>, mwana ya Aloni, ke vwanda kintwadi na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, na ntangu yina <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ke baka <char style="w">dime</char>. Na kati ya kikunku yina ya bawu, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ke katula mpe dime. Ba ke nata yawu samu na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto, na kati ya bivinga ya yinzo yina ba ke bumbaka bimvwama. <verse eid="NEH 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 10:40" />Samu ti, ni na kati ya bivinga yina, bantu ya Isayeli na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ke kwenda tula kikunku ya bambuma ya faline, ya vinu ya malu-malu, mpe ya mafuta ya malu-malu. Ni na kati ya bivinga yina kele bisalulu ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya longo</char>. Ni kuna mpe ke vwanda <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> yina ke salaka, bankebi ya myelo, mpe miyimbidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:40">Na mutindu yina, beto ke bika ve <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto.<verse eid="NEH 10:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ba-Zwife yina vutukaka na Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Bamfumu ya ba-Zwife kwendaka zinga na Yelusalemi. Bantu ya nkaka bulaka dzeke, samu na kuzaba nani na kati ya kumi ya bantu ke kwenda zinga na Yelusalemi, mbanza ya longo. Bantu yivwa ya nkaka ke bikana na bambanza ya nkaka. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Bantu sakumunaka bayina nyonso ndimaka, na luzolo ya bawu mosi, na kwenda zinga na Yelusalemi.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Ya vwandaka na bamfumu ya kizunga yina kwizaka zinga na Yelusalemi. Na bambanza ya Yuda, bantu ya Isayeli, <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bisadi ya Yinzo ya Yave mpe bana ya bisadi ya Salomoni, bawu vwandaka zinga na bayinzo ya bawu, mpe na bambanza ya bawu. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Ndambu ya bantu ya dikanda ya Yuda na ya Bezame kwendaka zinga na Yelusalemi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:4">Yayi ni bantu ya dikanda ya Yuda: Ataya, mwana ya Uziya, mwana ya Zakali, mwana ya Amalya, mwana ya Sefatya, mwana ya Malaleele, na kivumu ya Pelese, <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Maaseya, mwana ya Baluke, mwana ya Kole-Yoze, mwana ya Azaya, mwana ya Adaya, mwana ya Yoyalibe, mwana ya Zakali, mwana ya Asiloni. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Lutangu ya bantu ya dikanda ya Pelese, bayina kwendaka zinga na Yelusalemi vwandaka bankama yiya na makumi sambanu na nana (468) ya bantu ya ngolo.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Yayi ni bantu ya dikanda ya Bezame: Salu, mwana ya Mesulame, mwana ya Yowede, mwana ya Pedaya, mwana ya Kolaya, mwana ya Maaseya, mwana ya Ityele, mwana ya Esaya. <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Na manima ya yandi, Ngabayi, Salayi, lutangu ya bawu: bankama yivwa na makumi zole na nana (928). <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yowele, mwana ya Zikeli vwandaka mfumu ya bawu, mpe Yuda, mwana ya Asenuwa, vwanda mfumu ya zole ya mbanza.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Yayi ni <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>: Yedaya, mwana ya Yoyalive, Yakine, <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Selaya, mwana ya Yilekya, mwana ya Mesulame, mwana ya Sadoke, mwana ya Melayote, mwana ya Ayitube, ntwadisi ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />Bampangi ya bawu, bayina vwandaka sala na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, lutangu ya bawu: bankama nana na makumi zole na zole (822). Adaya, mwana ya Yeloyame, mwana ya Pelalya, mwana ya Amesi, mwana ya Zakali, mwana ya Pasewule, mwana ya Malekiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />na bampangi ya yandi bamfumu ya makanda, lutangu ya bawu: bankama zole na makumi yiya na zole (242), Amasesayi, mwana ya Azalele, mwana ya Azayi, mwana ya Mesilemote, mwana ya Imele, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />na bampangi ya bawu, babakala yina ke na ngolo na kibakala, lutangu ya bawu: nkama mosi na makumi zole na nana (128). <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya bawu vwandaka Zabedyele, mwana ya Ngedolime.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Na kati ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ya vwandaka: Semaya, mwana ya Asube, mwana ya Azelikame, mwana ya Asabya, mwana ya Buni, <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />mpe Sabetayi na Yozabade, na lutangu ya <char style="w">bakuluntu</char> ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bayina vwandaka twadisa kisalu ya ngaanda ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Matanya, mwana ya Mika, mwana ya Zabedi, mwana ya Asafe, yina vwandaka twadisa mikunga ya nzitusu na ntangu ya lusambulu. Bakebukya, kilandi mpe mosi na bampangi ya yandi, na Abeda, mwana ya Samuwa, mwana ya Ngalale, mwana ya Yedutune. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Lutangu ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> yina vwandaka na kati ya mbanza ya longo vwandaka, bankama zole na makumi nana na yiya (284).<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Bankebi ya myelo: Akube, Talemone na bampangi ya bawu yina vwandaka kengidila myelo, lutangu ya bawu: nkama mosi na makumi nsambwadi na zole (172).<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Bantu ya nkaka ya Isayeli, <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bawu vwandaka zinga na kati ya bambanza nyonso ya Yuda, konso muntu na kati ya ntoto ya yandi. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Bisadi ya Yinzo ya Yave vwandaka zinga na kisika yina ba ke bokilaka Ofele. Siya na Ngisepa vwandaka bamfumu ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />
    <char style="w">Mfumu</char> ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> na Yelusalemi vwandaka Uzi, mwana ya Bani, mwana ya Asabya, mwana ya Matanya, mwana ya Mika na kati ya bana ya Asafe. Bawu vwandaka miyimbidi yina vwandaka yimbila na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Ntinu pesaka lutumu na yina me tadila miyimbidi mpe lukanu na yina me tadila kisalu ya bawu ya konso kilumbu.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petaya, mwana ya Mesezabele, na kati ya bana ya Zela, mwana ya Yuda. Yandi vwandaka pene-pene ya ntinu, samu na mambu nyonso yina me tadila bantu.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba-Zwife yina vwandaka ve na Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Na yina me tadila babwala yina kele pene-pene ya bilanga, bana ya nkaka ya dikanda ya Yuda kwendaka zinga na Kilyate-Aleba, mpe na babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu. Ba ya nkaka, na Dibone mpe na babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu. Ba ya nkaka dyaka, na Yekabeseele mpe na babwala yina kele na yawu. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Bantu yango ya nkaka kwendaka na babwala Yeswa, Molada, Bete-Pelete, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Asale-Suwale, Beele-Seba mpe babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Sikelange, Mekona mpe babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Eyine-Limone, Soleya, Yalemute, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zanowa, Adulame mpe babwala yina kele kuna, Lakise na bilanga ya bwala yina, Azeka mpe babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu. Bawu kwendaka zinga kubanda na Beele-Seba na banda tii na mudimba ya Yinome na londe.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Bana ya Bezame kwenda zinga na Ngeba, na Mikemase, na Aya, na Betele mpe na babwala yina kele pene-pene na yawu, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />na Anatote, na Nobe, na Ananya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />na Asole, na Lama, na Ngitayime, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />na Adide, na Seboyime, na Nebalate, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />na Lode, mpe Ono, na mudimba ya bantu yina ke salaka bisalu ya maboko.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Bankonga ya nkaka ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> ya Yuda kwendaka zinga na sika ya bantu ya Bezame.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="w">Banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe <char style="w">ba-Levi</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Yayi ni bankumbu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, bayina katukaka na bundongo mpe kwizaka na Zolobabele, mwana ya Saletyele, na Yeswa: Selaya, Yilemeya, Esedase, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amalya, Maluke, Atuse, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Sekanya, Lewume, Melemote, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Nginetoyi, Abya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamine, Maadya, Bilenga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Semaya, Yoyalibe, Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu, Amoke, Yilekya, Yedaya. Ni bawu vwandaka bamfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe ya bampangi ya bawu, na ntangu ya Yeswa. <verse eid="NEH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Ba-Levi: Yeswa, Binwi, Kademyele, Selebya, Yuda, Matanya, yandi na bampangi ya yandi vwandaka yimbila mikunga ya nzitusu. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakebukya mpe Uni, na bampangi ya bawu, vwandaka na mantwala ya bawu, samu na kusadisa bawu.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yeswa butaka Yoyakime, Yoyakime butaka Elyasibe, mpe Elyasibe butaka Yoyada. <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada butaka Yonatane, Yonatane butaka Yaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yayi ni <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> yina vwandaka bamfumu ya makanda na ntangu ya Yoyakime: Melaya samu na dikanda ya Selaya, Ananya samu na dikanda ya Yilemeya, <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Mesulame samu na dikanda ya Esedase, Yewoyanane samu na dikanda ya Amalya, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Yonatane samu na dikanda ya Meliku, Yosefi samu na dikanda ya Sebanya, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adena samu na dikanda ya Alime, Elekayi samu na dikanda ya Melayote, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zakali samu na dikanda ya Ido, Mesulame samu na dikanda ya Nginetone, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikeli samu na dikanda ya Abya, samu na dikanda ya Minyamine, Piletayi samu na dikanda ya Mowadya, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Samuwa samu na dikanda ya Bilenga, Yonatane samu na dikanda ya Semaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenayi samu na dikanda ya Yoyalibe, Uzi samu na dikanda ya Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalayi samu na dikanda ya Salayi, Ebele samu na dikanda ya Amoke, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Asabya samu na dikanda ya Yilekya, Netanele samu na dikanda ya Yedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Na ntangu ya Elyasibe, na Yoyada, na Yoyanane, na Yaduwa, bankumbu ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, bayina vwandaka bamfumu ya makanda, vwandaka ya kusonama tii na ntangu yina Dalyuse vwandaka ntinu ya Pelese.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Bankumbu ya bana ya Levi, bayina vwandaka bamfumu ya makanda, yawu vwandaka ya kusonama na kati ya dibuku ya kinkulu, tii na ntangu ya Yoyanane, mwana ya Elyasibe.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Yayi ni bankumbu ya bamfumu ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>: Asabya, Selebya mpe Yeswa, mwana ya Kademyele na bampangi ya bawu, yina vwandaka yimbila na mantwala ya bawu mutindu Davidi, muntu ya Nzambi, tumisaka yawu. Konso nkonga, na ntangu ya yandi, vwandaka yimbila mikunga ya nzitusu mpe ya matondo.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Bankebi ya myelo Matanya, Bakebukya, Obadya, Mesulame, Talemone, mpe Akube, bawu vwandaka keba myelo ya bayinzo ya bibumbulu, yina vwandaka pene-pene na myelo ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Bantu yayi, vwandaka sala kisalu ya bawu na ntangu ya Yoyakime, mwana ya Yeswa, mwana ya Yosadake, mpe na ntangu ya Neyemi, mfumu ya kizunga, mpe ya <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> Esedase, <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukembo ya mbyekolo ya kibaka ya Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Na ntangu ya mukembo ya mbyekolo ya kibaka ya lupangu ya Yelusalemi, ba kwendaka bokila <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> na bisika nyonso yina bawu vwandaka zinga, samu ti, bawu kwiza na Yelusalemi, samu na kukembila mukembo ya mbyekolo na kyese nyonso. Bawu zolaka kembila yawu na kuvutulaka matondo mpe na kuyimbilaka mikunga, na basembale<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.27 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Basembale </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:10">Esd 3.10</ref> </char></note>, na bansambi. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Bana ya miyimbidi kwizaka vukana kukatuka na mwa kizunga yina kele pene-pene ya Yelusalemi, na babwala ya ba-Netofate, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />na bwala Bete-Ngilengale, na bilanga ya Ngeba mpe ya Azemawete, samu ti, miyimbidi tungaka babwala ya bawu pene-pene na Yelusalemi. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" /><char style="w">Banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> vedisaka banzutu ya bawu. Bawu vedisaka bantu, na myelo, na kibaka ya lupangu.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Mu yulukisaka bamfumu ya Yuda na zulu ya kibaka ya lupangu. Mu yidikaka bimvuka zole ya nene ya miyimbidi. Kimvuka ya ntete vwandaka kwenda na lweka ya diboko ya lubakala, na zulu ya kibaka ya lupangu. Bawu lutilaka ntama ve na mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka Mboloso. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Oseya, mpe ndambu ya bamfumu ya Yuda, vwandaka tambula na manima ya bawu, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Azalya, Esedase, Mesulame, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda, Bezame, Semaya, na Yilemeya. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Na kati ya bana ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, bayina vwandaka na bakulumenta: Zakali, mwana ya Yonatane, mwana ya Semaya, mwana ya Matanya, mwana ya Mikaya, mwana ya Zakule, mwana ya Asafe, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />na bampangi ya yandi Semaya, Azalele, Milalayi, Ngilalayi, Maayi, Netanele, Yuda, Anani, bawu vwandaka na bisikulu ya Davidi, muntu ya Nzambi. Esedase <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char> vwandaka na mantwala ya bawu. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Na kisika yina kele mwelo yina ba bokilaka mwelo ya Mukelo, na mantwala ya bawu, bawu tambulaka na zulu ya bikada ya mbanza ya Davidi, na zulu ya kibaka ya lupangu, na zulu ya yinzo ya Davidi tii na esete, na mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka mwelo ya Maza.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Kimvuka ya zole ya miyimbidi vwandaka kwenda na lweka ya diboko ya lumoso. Munu mosi vwandaka na manima ya bawu, kintwadi na ndambu ya nkonga. Beto vwandaka tambula na zulu ya kibaka ya lupangu, pene-pene ya yinzo ya mutela ya yinda yina ba ke bokilaka Bafule tii na kibaka ya nene, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />na zulu ya mwelo ya Efalayime, na ya mwelo ya Yesana, na ya mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka, mwelo ya Bambisi, na ya yinzo ya mutela ya yinda ya Ananeele, mpe na yinzo ya mutela ya yinda yina ba ke bokilaka Nkama, tii na mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka, mwelo ya Mameme. Ba kwizaka suka na mwelo yina ba ke bokilaka, mwelo ya bankebi. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Na manima, bimvuka nyonso zole ya miyimbidi kwendaka telamaka na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> na munu mosi, mpe na ndambu ya bamfumu ya mbanza yina vwandaka na munu. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" /><char style="w">Banganga-Nzambi</char> Elyakime, Maaseya, Minyamine, Mikaya, Elyoyenayi, Zakali, na Ananya, vwandaka na bakulumenta. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Ya vwandaka mpe na Maaseya, Semaya, Eleyazale, Uzi, Yewoyanane, Malekya, Elame, na Ezele. Miyimbidi vwandaka yimbila mikunga na lutwadusu ya Yizelaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Na kilumbu yina, bantu pesaka minkayulu mingi na nsayi nyonso, samu ti Nzambi salaka ti, bawu kuvwanda na nsayi mingi. Bakento na bana mpe vwandaka yangalala. Makelele ya nsayi, yina vwandaka na Yelusalemi, vwandaka wakana ntama.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikunku ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Na kilumbu yina, ba soolaka bantu samu na kukengidila bivinga yina ba kubikaka, samu na kubumbaka makabu. Makabu yina ni <char style="w">badime</char>, na bambuma ya ntete mpe Badime. Ba vwandaka tula na kati ya bivinga yina, bima yina vwandaka katuka na bilanga yina kele pene-pene na bambanza, bikunku yina <char style="w">Musiku</char> tumisaka, samu na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>. Bantu ya Yuda vwandaka yangalala, samu na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> mpe <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> yina vwandaka sala. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Bawu vwandaka sala kisalu ya Nzambi ya bawu, na kisalu ya kuvedisa. Miyimbidi na bankebi ya myelo vwandaka sadila mutindu tumisaka Davidi na mwana ya yandi Salomoni. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Na ntangu ya ntama, yina Davidi na Asafe vwandaka ntete moyo, ya vwandaka na bamfumu ya miyimbidi. Ya vwandaka mpe na mikunga ya nzitusu, na ya kuvutula matondo na Nzambi. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Na ntangu ya Zolobabele mpe na ntangu ya Neyemi, konso kilumbu, bantu nyonso ya Isayeli vwandaka pesa bikunku ya miyimbidi na ya bankebi ya myelo. Bawu vwandaka pesa mpe bikunku ya longo ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, mpe <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> vwandaka pesa bikunku ya longo ya bana ya Aloni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bansobolo yina Neyemi salaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Na ntangu yina, ya vwandaka kilumbu mosi, ba tangilaka bantu nyonso mambu ya dibuku ya Moyize, ni kuna ba talaka ti, ya vwandaka ya kusonama mutindu yayi: Ba-Amone na ba-Mowabe fwana kukota ata fyoti ve na nkonga ya bantu ya Nzambi, <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />samu ti, bawu yambaka mbote ve bana ya Isayeli, bawu pesaka ve bawu madya na maza. Ba-Mowabe futaka Balame, samu na kusiinga bawu. Kasi Nzambi ya beto sobaka nsiingulu yango na lusakumunu. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ntangu ba kuwaka <char style="w">Musiku</char> yina, ba katulaka banzenza na kati ya bana ya Isayeli.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Mambu yayi salamaka, samu ti na bilumbu yina lutaka, Elyasibe, <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char>, yina vwandaka na kiyeko ya bivinga ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya beto, yandi vwandaka muntu ya dikanda ya Tobya. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Yandi bongisaka kivinga ya nene samu na Tobya, na kisika yina ba vwandaka bumba minkayulu ya madya ya bilanga, <char style="w">maaka ya nsunga</char> ya mbote, bima nyonso yina bawu vwandaka sadila na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, <char style="w">dime</char> ya bambuma ya faline, dime ya vinu ya malu-malu, dime ya mafuta ya malu-malu, bima yina ba tumisaka samu na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, samu na miyimbidi, mpe samu na bankebi ya myelo, mutindu mosi mpe kikunku samu na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ntangu mambu nyonso yayi vwandaka salama, mu vwandaka ve na Yelusalemi. Na mvula ya makumi tatu na zole ya kintinu ya Aletazelezese, ntinu ya Babilone, mu vutukaka na sika ya ntinu. Na manima ya mwa bilumbu, mu lombaka na ntinu muswa ya kubika yandi. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Mu vutukaka na Yelusalemi mpe mu bakulaka yimbi yina Elyasibe salaka samu na Tobya, na kupesa yandi kivinga na kati ya lupangu ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Dyambu yayi salaka munu mpasi mingi. Na yina, mu tumisaka ba basisa bima ya Tobya nyonso na ngaanda. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Mu tumisaka ti ba vedisa bivinga mpe mu tubaka ti ba vutula na bivinga yina bima ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, minkayulu ya madya ya bilanga, na <char style="w">maaka ya nsunga</char> ya mbote.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Mu kwizaka zaba mpe ti ba pesaka ve <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> kikunku ya bawu, mpe miyimbidi yina vwandaka sala na kati ya <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>, bawu kimaka ya bawu, konso muntu vutukaka na bwala ya yandi. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Na yina, mu ngalaka bamfumu ya mbanza na kutuba: «Samu na yinki beno me bika <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char>?» Mu kutikisaka <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> na miyimbidi, mpe mu vutulaka bawu konso muntu na kisika ya yandi ya kisalu. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Bantu nyonso ya Yuda nataka <char style="w">dime</char> ya bambuma ya faline, ya vinu ya malu-malu, mpe ya mafuta ya malu-malu, samu na kutula yawu na bibumbulu. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Mu soolaka <char style="w">nganga-Nzambi</char> Selemya, na Sadoke <char style="w">mulongisi ya Misiku</char>, na Pedaya mosi kati ya <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, samu ti bawu kukengidila bibumbulu. Pene-pene ya bawu, mu tulaka mpe Anane, mwana ya Zakule, mwana ya Matanya, samu ti bawu vwandaka talana mutindu bantu ya kukwikama. Ni bawu vwandaka na kiyeko ya kukabulaka bikunku na bampangi ya bawu.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Mu sambilaka: «Nzambi ya munu, bambukila munu moyo, samu na nyonso yina. Kuzimbana ve kukwikama yina mu me vwanda na yawu samu na <char style="w">Yinzo ya Nzambi</char> ya munu mpe samu na kisalu ya yawu.»<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Kaka na bilumbu yina, mu talaka na Yuda bantu yina vwandaka kamuna vinu na kilumbu ya Saba. Bawu vwandaka nata matiti ya bambuma, bawu vwandaka tula mpe na zulu ya bambuluku, vinu, bambuma ya vinu, <char style="w">bafike</char> na mifuna ya mutindu na mutindu, samu na kunata yawu na Yelusalemi na kilumbu ya Saba. Mu ngalaka bawu na ntangu yina, bawu vwandaka tekisa bima ya bawu na kilumbu ya Saba. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Bantu ya Tile, yina vwandaka zinga kuna, bawu vwandaka nata bambisi, na bima ya mutindu na mutindu, yina bawu vwandaka tekisa na bantu ya Yuda mpe na kati ya Yelusalemi, na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Mu ngalaka bantwadisi ya Yuda na kutuba: «Yayi wapi mutindu ya mambu ya yimbi, beno ke na kusala? Beno ke na kusumuna kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>. <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Bankooko ya beno mpe salaka mutindu yina. Ni yawu yina, Nzambi ya beto me sala ti, beto na mbanza yayi kuvwanda na kati ya mpasi nyonso yayi. Kasi beno, mutindu beno ke na kusumuna kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>, beno ke na kubwela dyaka nkele ya Nzambi, samu na Isayeli!»<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ntangu bwisi bandaka na kuyila, mu tumisaka ti, ba kanga myelo ya Yelusalemi tekila <char style="w">Saba</char> kubanda. Mu tumisaka ti, ba fungula yawu ve tii na manima ya <char style="w">Saba</char>. Mu tulaka ndambu ya bisadi ya munu kuna na myelo, samu ti ata mufuna mosi kukota ve na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Bantu ya mumbungu, na bayina vwandaka tekisa bima ya mutindu na mutindu, bawu lutisaka mpimpa mbala mosi to zole na ngaanda ya Yelusalemi. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Mu kebisaka bawu na kutuba: «Samu na yinki beno ke na lutisa mpimpa na mantwala ya bibaka? Kana beno meka dyaka, mu ke kangisa beno!» Kubanda kilumbu yina, bawu vwandaka kwiza dyaka ve na kilumbu ya <char style="w">Saba</char>. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Mu tubaka mpe na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char> na kuvedisa banzutu ya bawu, samu na kukwiza kengidila myelo mpe na kuzitisa kilumbu ya Saba, kilumbu ya longo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Mu sambilaka: «Nzambi ya munu, bambukila munu moyo mpe samu na yina. Tala munu kyadi mutindu kele bunene ya kukwikama ya nge.»<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Kaka na bilumbu yina mpe, mu talaka ba-Zwife yina kwelaka bakento ya ba-Asedode, ya ba-Amone, na ya ba-Mowabe. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Ndambu ya bana ya bawu vwandaka zonza ndinga ya ba-Asedode mpe ata mosi na bawu vwandaka lenda na kuzonza ndinga ya ba-Zwife, kasi bawu vwandaka zonza ndinga ya bantu yayi to ya bantu ya nkaka. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Mu sembaka bawu mpe mu siingaka bawu. Mu bulaka ba ya nkaka na kati ya bawu, mpe mu timunaka bawu bansuki ya yintu. Na manima, mu tubaka na bawu na kudya ndefi na nkumbu ya Nzambi ti, bawu ke kwelisa ve bana ya bawu ya bakento na banzenza, mpe bana ya bawu ya babakala to bawu mosi, ke kwela ve banzenza. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />«Ni samu na mambu yina, Salomoni, ntinu ya Isayeli kubwaka na masumu. Na lutangu ya bayinsi mingi, ya vwandaka ve na ntinu mutindu yandi. Nzambi ya yandi zolaka yandi mpe yandi tulaka yandi ntinu ya Isayeli nyonso. Kasi ni yandi bakento ya nzenza bwisaka na masumu. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Beto zola dyaka ve kuwa ti, beno ke na kusala na ntadisi ya Nzambi ya beto, busafu yayi ya kukwela bakento ya nzenza.»<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Mosi na kati ya bana ya Yoyada, mwana ya Elyasibe, mfumu ya <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char>, yandi kwelaka mwana ya Sambala ya mu-Yolone. Mu bingisaka yandi ntama na munu.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Mu sambilaka: «Nzambi ya munu, bambukila bawu moyo samu ti, bawu me sumuna kisalu ya <char style="w">bunganga-Nzambi</char>, na ngwisani yina nge salaka na <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>.»<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Mu vedisaka bawu na kukatula bantu nyonso ya nzenza na kati ya bawu, mu vutulaka bisalu nyonso yina me tadila <char style="w">banganga-Nzambi</char> na <char style="w">ba-Levi</char>, konso muntu na kisalu ya yandi. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Mu vutulaka mpe makabu ya bankuni na ntangu ya yawu, mutindu mosi mpe makabu ya bambuma ya ntete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Mu sambilaka: «Nzambi ya munu, bambukila munu moyo na mambu ya mbote.»<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>